Warrior find close parallels in other burials in western Messenia: for instance,
a cushion seal with gold caps is similar to one from Myrsinochori: Routsi,” and 
an agate seal depicting a griffin resembles one from the Nichoria tholos.' A 
bronze battle-knife with a terminal ring, like those from Shaft Grave IV at 
