{'title': 'Reception in scholarship', 'section_type': 'section', 'blocks': 
[{'text': 'Evans\x00b4s 1925 publication "\x00b4The Ring of Nestor\x00b4: A 
Glimpse into the Minoan Afterworld and A Sepulchral Treasure of Gold 
Signet-Rings and Bead-Seals from Thisbe, Boeotia" is widely cited as the 
foundational study of the ring, with bibliographic records from institutions 
